1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:03,200
(Sheldon:)I sense judgment on your part.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,500
(Leonard:)No, no.

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:07,120
(Leonard:)Maybe a little.

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:11,270
(Sheldon:)May I suggest that your
criticism is based on jealousy.

5
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:14,090
(Leonard:)Jealousy? What do I
have to be jealous of?

6
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:16,950
(Sheldon:)I have a functioning
and satisfying relationship

7
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,280
(Sheldon:)with a female.

8
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:21,720
(Sheldon:)You have none.

9
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:24,370
(Leonard:)Oh, right. That.

10
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:26,810
(Sheldon:)Jealousy is an ugly
green-eyed monster--

11
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:27,940
(Sheldon:)not unlike the Hulk--

12
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,840
(Sheldon:)who, by the way,
also has a girlfriend.

13
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:33,040
(Sheldon:)In this iteration,
Jennifer Connelly,

14
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:35,760
(Sheldon:)whom you may recall as
the girlfriend of Russell Crowe

15
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:36,830
in A Beautiful Mind,

16
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:40,390
(Sheldon:)a feel-good romp if
there ever was one.

17
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,570
(Leonard:)I'm not jealous.

18
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:46,530
(Sheldon:)Leonard not jealous.

19
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:51,160
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

